      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "The as-cast HfMoTaTiZr baseline has a room-temperature yield strength of approximately 1600 MPa.",
      "field": "material_initial_state",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "The as-cast HfMoTaTiZr baseline has a yield strength of approximately 855 MPa at 1000 °C.",
      "field": "material_initial_state",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "Approximately 20–30% of the Hf content should be replaced by Al.",
      "field": "intervention",
      "needs_support": false,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "Replacing part of the heavy Hf with lower-density Al will reduce alloy density and average atomic mass.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC5995863::chunk::001::introduction::a6c9e13965"
      ],
      "same_system": "no"
    },
    {
      "text": "Al stabilizes BCC-related structures in low-density refractory high-entropy alloys.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "Partial Hf-to-Al substitution in HfMoTaTiZr will form or retain a high-strength BCC or inverted BCC+B2 microstructure.",
      "field": "structural_mediator",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC5995863::chunk::000::abstract::63aa5c975c",
        "PMC5995863::chunk::001::introduction::a6c9e13965"
      ],
      "same_system": "no"
    },
    {
      "text": "Al substitution may promote fine strengthening precipitates in HfMoTaTiZr.",
      "field": "structural_mediator",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "An inverted BCC+B2 microstructure consists of discrete B2 precipitates dispersed in a continuous BCC matrix.",
      "field": "structural_mediator",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "entailed",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC5995863::chunk::000::abstract::63aa5c975c"
      ],
      "same_system": "unclear"
    },
    {
      "text": "An inverted BCC+B2 microstructure can improve room-temperature compressive ductility while maintaining high room- and elevated-temperature yield strength in RHEAs.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "entailed",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC5995863::chunk::000::abstract::63aa5c975c"
      ],
      "same_system": "unclear"
    },
    {
      "text": "Second-generation RHEAs using lower-density refractory elements and additions such as Al and Ti achieved lower density while retaining strong high-temperature properties.",
      "field": "structural_mediator",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "entailed",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC5995863::chunk::001::introduction::a6c9e13965"
      ],
      "same_system": "no"
    },
    {
      "text": "The Al-substituted alloy will have a density below approximately 9.5 g/cm³.",
      "field": "predicted_outcome",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "The Al-substituted alloy will retain room-temperature yield strength within approximately 5–10% of 1600 MPa.",
      "field": "predicted_outcome",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "The Al-substituted alloy will retain its 1000 °C yield strength within approximately 5–10% of 855 MPa.",
